oking at three F# bug fixes that came after the previous run—completion filtering for obsolete members, a warning range correction, and a quotation-related fix. The first two are user-facing improvements worth documenting, so I'll add a brief bug fixes section to the F# notes since these changes are now part of the preview3 build.",
