s in .NET 11:\\n\\n- [What's new in F#](https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/fsharp/whats-new/) documentation\", \"path\": \"/home/runner/work/dotnet-core-release-notes/dotnet-core-release-notes/release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/fsharp.md\"}"
